# Deploy-specific dockerignore — overrides root .dockerignore
# Only exclude things we truly don't need in any container build
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/.git
**/node_modules
**/.next
*.md
!registry/*.md
.DS_Store
*.swp
*.key
*.secret
.scratch-*
archive/
docs/
sandbox/
staging/sim-network/
staging/sim-device/
agents/
data/
.gitnexus/
.claude/
console/test-results/
